      en: ["Musk oxen were successfully introduced from Greenland in 1932.", "Snøhetta is the highest peak in Norway outside Jotunheimen at 2,286m.", "The national park was officially established in its current form in 2002.", "The total protected area covers 1,693 square kilometers.", "Dovrefjell is home to one of Europe's last original wild reindeer herds.", "The park is famous for its diversity of rare arctic-alpine flora."],
